# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*~

# Local Claude Code overrides — never committed
.claude/settings.local.json

# Agent worktrees (harness-managed isolated checkouts for subagents) — never commit these.
.claude/worktrees/

# Scrum local-only feeds — friction notes (retro-log.local.md) and the SubagentStop hook's dispatch
# feed (dispatch.local.md). One glob covers both and any future *.local.md stream; never committed.
docs/process/*.local.md

# Never track an MCP server file at any depth — user secrets reach a plugin only through
# userConfig with sensitive: true. The validation gate fails if one is ever tracked.
.mcp.json
